          <id>48</id>
          <items xsi:type="form:Decoration">
            <name>UseQualityHint</name>
            <id>40</id>
            <title>
              <key>en</key>
              <value>Create an item with the respective quality:
Limited quality. Upon intermediate release of finished products to a warehouse.
Not usable. Upon release of nonconforming products.</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>fa</key>
              <value>قلمی با کیفیت مربوطه ایجاد کنید:
کیفیت محدود. هنگام عرضه میانی محصولات ساخته‌شده به انبار.
غیرقابل استفاده. هنگام عرضه محصولات نامنطبق.</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>ru</key>
              <value>Создавать номенклатуру с качеством:
&quot;Ограниченно годен&quot; при промежуточном выпуске изделий на склад.
&quot;Не годен&quot; при выпуске бракованных изделий.</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>tr</key>
              <value>Kalite ile ilgili bir öğe oluştur:
&quot;Sınırlı uygun&quot; ara nihai ürün çıkışları için.
&quot;Uygun değil&quot; kusurlu ürünler için.</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>vi</key>
              <value>Tạo mặt hàng với chất lượng:
&quot;Dùng được hạn chế&quot; khi xuất xưởng trung gian đến kho.
&quot;Không dùng được&quot; khi xuất xưởng sản phẩm bị lỗi.</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>it</key>
              <value>Create an item with the respective quality:
Limited quality. Upon intermediate release of finished products to a warehouse.
Not usable. Upon release of nonconforming products.</value>
            </title>
            <title>
              <key>pl</key>
              <value>Create an item with the respective quality:
Limited quality. Upon intermediate release of finished products to a warehouse.
Not usable. Upon release of nonconforming products.</value>
            </title>
            <visible>true</visible>
            <enabled>true</enabled>
            <userVisible>
              <common>true</common>
            </userVisible>
